-step descent; closed-toe shoes mandatory; no water access since 1992; the risk here is the stairs, not the water","commission":"voucher via licensed agency; entry fee pass-through","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","wildlife":"destination"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{"name":"Buraco das Araras (macaw sinkhole)","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"essential","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buraco_das_Araras_Private_Natural_Heritage_Reserve","hook":"Huge sandstone crater near Jardim; South America''s largest sinkhole; sanctuary for red-and-green macaws plus toucans/araçaris. Best at early morning / late afternoon","si":"wildlife","blurb":"Huge sandstone crater near Jardim; South America''s largest sinkhole; sanctuary for red-and-green macaws plus toucans/araçaris. Best at early morning / late afternoon","commission":"AOR → licensed reserve access","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{"name":"Night float","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.livemoretravelmore.com/things-to-do-in-bonito-brazil/","si":"wildlife","commission":"licensed-agency voucher","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{"name":"Pantanal wildlife extension (gateway)","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.aventuradobrasil.com/blog/bonito-brazils-natural-gem-of-crystal-clear-rivers-and-hidden-caves/","hook":"The high-value pairing: Bonito''s clear water + Pantanal''s unmatched wildlife density. Same regional DMC can carry both","si":"wildlife","blurb":"The high-value pairing: Bonito''s clear water + Pantanal''s unmatched wildlife density. Same regional DMC can carry both","commission":"AOR combo mandate (Bonito + Pantanal)","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to snorkel Bonito''s crystal rivers?","a":"The dry season — roughly June–September, within the broader May–September dry window — delivers the clearest, most predictable water, because the winter rains that raise rivers and drop visibility have stopped; daily visitor slots are physically capped, so book at least a week ahead in high season (July–September).","source":"lonelyplanet.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Can you actually see wild macaws near Bonito?","a":"Yes — Buraco das Araras, South America''s largest sinkhole (~500 m circumference, ~100 m deep) near Jardim, is a heavily regulated sanctuary for red-and-green macaws plus toucans and araçaris, best viewed at early morning or late afternoon on a guided visit.","source":"en.wikipedia.org, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"wildlife"},{"q":"Is Bonito a good honeymoon destination?","a":"Yes, as a slow water-and-forest romance add-on rather than a luxury-ceremony market: the top of the market is the 4-star Zagaia Eco Resort — grounds, pools and full recreation — with boutique eco-pousadas filling the couples tier, so set expectations to best-in-region eco, not five-star.","source":"evendo.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"Is the Abismo Anhumas cave rappel dangerous?","a":"It is a serious, technical activity run safely under a guided-mandatory system: a 72 m harness rappel on electric devices into a cavern lake (~18°C water, submerged cones to ~20 m), capped at a maximum of 16 people per day with certified monitors — never a free-climb and never sold unguided.","source":"explore-share.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in Bonito?","a":"Sell-outs, not danger: because every attraction runs on a licensed-agency voucher with hard daily caps, marquee tours like Rio da Prata and Rio Sucuri can sell out weeks ahead of time, so the booking *is* the reservation — reserve the voucher itinerary, not just the room.","source":"en.wikivoyage.org, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Bonito, Brazil: Crystal-River Snorkeling, Caves & the Pantanal Gateway — TravelWell","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","search_language":"pt-BR","local_keywords":["Bonito MS o que fazer","Rio da Prata flutuação","Gruta do Lago Azul","melhor época para ir a Bonito","Abismo Anhumas rapel","Boca da Onça cachoeira","Bonito e Pantanal roteiro","Buraco das Araras Jardim"],"hreflang":["en","pt-BR"],"primary_keyword":"Bonito","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-20","last_verified_basis":"safety.fcdo.read","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/brazil","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:23Z","source_updated":"2026-05-11T12:32:48+01:00"}]},"content_freshness":"2026-07-07"},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"wildlife","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Zagaia Eco Resort","positioning":"4-star Bonito ceiling","earning":"room commission","mor":"DMC/AOR","tier":"Premium (regional ceiling)"},{"name":"Santa Esmeralda","positioning":"upper-boutique eco-pousada","earning":"room commission / bedbank","mor":"AOR/bedbank","tier":"Premium-lite"},{"name":"Boutique eco-pousadas (curated)","positioning":"de